Entries of a dependentRequired keyword must be arrays of strings,
and entries of a dependentSchemas keyword must be schemas.
The error for an entry of any other kind says what its keyword expects.

-- schema.json --
{
    "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
    "dependentRequired": {
        "a": {"type": "string"},
        "b": true,
        "c": 1234
    },
    "dependentSchemas": {
        "d": ["e"],
        "f": 1234
    }
}
-- out/decode/extract --
ERROR:
value of "a" in "dependentRequired" must be an array of strings, found struct:
    schema.json:4:10
value of "b" in "dependentRequired" must be an array of strings, found bool:
    schema.json:5:10
value of "c" in "dependentRequired" must be an array of strings, found int:
    schema.json:6:10
value of "d" in "dependentSchemas" must be an object or boolean, found list:
    schema.json:9:10
value of "f" in "dependentSchemas" must be an object or boolean, found int:
    schema.json:10:10
